STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Times Roman 29px strike for CrossPoint Reader, filling the gap between
COMMENT the X.org Adobe 100dpi 18pt (25px) and 24pt (34px) strikes.
COMMENT Grid-fitted from URW Nimbus outlines, then hand-tuned pixel by pixel to
COMMENT the conventions of the Adobe strikes; accents composed from tuned parts.
FONT -CrossPoint-Times-Medium-R-Normal--29-210-100-100-P-145-ISO10646-1
SIZE 21 100 100
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 34 41 -5 -9
STARTPROPERTIES 21
FOUNDRY "CrossPoint"
FAMILY_NAME "Times"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SLANT "R"
SETWIDTH_NAME "Normal"
ADD_STYLE_NAME ""
PIXEL_SIZE 29
POINT_SIZE 210
RESOLUTION_X 100
RESOLUTION_Y 100
SPACING "P"
AVERAGE_WIDTH 145
CHARSET_REGISTRY "ISO10646"
CHARSET_ENCODING "1"
CAP_HEIGHT 19
X_HEIGHT 13
FONT_ASCENT 23
FONT_DESCENT 7
FACE_NAME "Times Roman"
DEFAULT_CHAR 0
FULL_NAME "Times Roman"
ENDPROPERTIES
